Subject: [PATCH 13/13] fix(linux): load a page's own srcdoc, data: and blob:
 frames

Cloudflare's challenge stayed on "Verifying..." in Zephium while plain
WebKitGTK passed it: WebKitGTK asks the navigation handler about every
frame without naming one, and the handler refused srcdoc, data: and
blob: documents, which challenge and payment widgets are built from.

- They are judged as about:blank there, as macOS judges a subframe's.
- WebKitGTK names the frame only at the response, so the platform layer
  refuses them there as a tab's own document, as before.
